{'symbol': 'AKAM', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'AKAMAI TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQGS:AKAM) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF EXCEDA LTDA.', 'text': "AKAMAI TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQGS:AKAM) ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE EXCEDA LTDA ON SEPTEMBER 9, 2019. THE ALL-CASH TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2019. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO BE $0.01 DILUTIVE TO ITS NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE FOR 2019, AND $0.01 - 0.02 ACCRETIVE IN 2020. THE ACQUISITION IS NOT EXPECTED TO IMPACT AKAMAI'S PREVIOUSLY-STATED GOAL OF ACHIEVING A NON-GAAP OPERATING MARGIN OF 30% BY 2020. MARCELLO HALLAKE OF JONES DAY ACTED AS LEGAL ADVISOR TO EXCEDA LTDA.\nAKAMAI TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQGS:AKAM) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF EXCEDA LTDA FOR $33 MILLION ON NOVEMBER 4, 2019.\n"}